      "type": "wondrous item",
      "desc": "This book contains guidelines for influencing and charming others and its words are charged with magic. If you spend 48 hours over a period of 6 days or fewer studying its contents and practicing its guidelines, your Charisma score increases by 2, to a maximum of 30. The manual then loses its magic, but regains it in a century.",
